  "body": "Session started 2026-06-04. 30 hands observed.\n\n**Preflop SB strategy (15 opportunities as SB):** Fold hand 1 (trash); limp hand 3 (Ac3d); raise 4x hand 5 (AKs); limp hand 7 (9s7d); raise 4x hand 9 (QJo); raise 4x hand 11 (QdJd); raise 4x hand 13 (TdQc); limp hand 15 (5s9h); limp hand 17 (5h4h); raise 4x hand 19 (TdTh); raise 4x hand 21 (Ad4s); limp hand 23 (Kd5h); limp hand 25 (5h4c); limp hand 27 (3h5c); limp hand 29 (8s9c). ~40% raise, ~53% limp, ~7% fold. Raise range: broadway+ (AKs, QJ+, QTo) AND medium pocket pairs (TT) AND weak aces (A4o). Limp range: ANY offsuit/suited connector or 1-gapper AND weak kings — VERY WIDE.\n\n**BB holdings observed (14 samples):** h4 ATo, h6 K7o, h8 As8c, h10 AdTc, h12 AsTs, h14 Ks3d, h16 3s6h, h18 3s6c, h20 7s6h, h22 2h5c, h24 7dKs, h26 Ad5s, h28 9cJh, h30 8d2d. Range is 100% — villain defends BB with any two cards. 14/14 confirmed.\n\n**Postflop — positionally aggressive; draw strength determines multi-barrel vs. give-up:**\n- IP with air (no equity): fires ONE flop barrel, gives up on turn if called (hand 15 confirmed).\n- IP with draw (OESD/flush): fires MULTIPLE barrels aggressively (hand 17 — semi-bluff flop; hand 25 — OESD flop; hand 29 — OESD, raised BOTH flop AND turn). NEW: Do NOT assume one call ends villain's aggression when he has a draw.\n- IP with air uncontested: takes pot (hands 3, 23, 27).\n- OOP: checks air through (hand 7 river check); bets turn with weak pair after checking flop (hand 2).\n- IP flop aggression count: 7/7 opportunities (100% c-bet/raise rate IP).\n\n**KEY REFINEMENT (hand 29):** Villain multi-barrels with draws — raised flop AND turn with 8s9c OESD on 3-4-5-7 board, never hit, lost to hero's AA. Pattern: AIR = one barrel then give up; DRAW = multiple barrels of aggression. Hero should call down with top pair+ regardless, but expect more action when draws are present.\n\n**Key exploit:** IP bets are 100% (7/7). His air bluffs are one-and-done; his draws are multi-street. Either way hero should call/raise with top pair+ — villain rarely has a made hand when betting IP into hero. SB limp range is extremely wide (offsuit connectors/1-gappers of any rank). BB range is 100% any-two-cards (14/14 confirmed including 82o).",
